              <characteristics>
                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon. May have composite bow +3 or javelins +2, light armour +3, buckler +1. May only lead Amorites. Any Amorite unit within 12" of the Chief may use his Leadership when it takes a Leadership test. 0-1. (Chariot Wars p.21)</characteristic>
