                <characteristic name="Text" typeId="63ac-8f60-d28a-2232">Hand weapon and composite bow. Skirmishers. Minimum unit size three models; the army may not include more mounted scouts than it has characters. 0-1 unit. (Chariot Wars p.22)</characteristic>
              </characteristics>
            </profile>
          </profiles>
          <infoLinks>
